PARITY  (web/src/features/dashboard/widgets/ClimateStatusWidget.tsx — THE specification)
================================================================================
Data sources (no HTTP in the view; ADR-002):
  useVehicles + useClimateLatest  -> ClimateStatusSource over the shared VehiclesStore (S8) / VehiclesRepository
    (S7) cache-then-network seam; latest climate is the raw JsonElement the shared layer serves for /climate/latest.
  useUnits -> UnitFormatter resolved from LocalDataContainer at the render boundary (SI -> display only there).
Field reads reproduced verbatim from the web source (typed contract): inside_temp / outside_temp (SI Celsius,
  convertTempFromSI via UnitFormatter, whole-degree like web fmtInt), hvac_power ("{n.n} kW" like fmtNumber(_,1);
  a non-number reads as the em dash, honouring the number type), defrost_mode (chip when present AND != "Off"),
  battery_heater_on (Heater chip). climateData falsy -> empty state.
States (all rendered; none hidden): loading (full skeleton, no header — web WidgetShell loading short-circuit),
  content (Cabin/Outside/HVAC rows + Defrost/Heater chips), empty ("No climate data"), error + stale + offline
  surfaced through the header DataFreshness chip + refresh control. NOTE: the web climate widget passes
  WidgetShell `isError` but NOT the `error` prop, so it has NO QueryError short-circuit; reproduced faithfully
  (the refresh IconButton is the retry affordance; cached snapshots stay visible on stale/offline).
i18n (P1/S10; every key already present in app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml):
  translation_widget_{climate,cabin,outside,hvac,defrost,batHeater,noClimate},
  translation_common_{refresh,loading,offline}, translation_a11y_loading, translation_freshness_{justNow,seconds,minutes,hours,days,weeks}.
Registry (web registry/climate.ts): id "climate-status", category "climate", default 1x2, min 1x2, max 2x40
  (ClimateStatusRegistration; unit-tested isWithinBounds/clamp). The web source ignores WidgetProps.size, so
  the surface renders identically at every footprint; the grid host honours min/max via the registration.
a11y: title carries heading(); every reading row, both chips, the loading skeleton, and the refresh control
  carry TalkBack content descriptions; font scale + theme via Material 3 tokens (P1/S9).
Telemetry: one-shot view.opened with slug "ClimateStatusWidget" (P1/S11), PII-safe (no cabin payload).

